<title>INDIA: India's Federal Bank 96/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India's Federal Bank 96/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     462.34 vs    451.89</p>
<p>    Interest earned	    5,874.99 vs  4,232.93</p>
<p>    Other income		   714.80 vs    682.90</p>
<p>    Interest expended	  4,720.81 vs  3,170.24</p>
<p>Provisions and</p>
<p>    contigencies		   278.94 vs    242.57</p>
<p>    Total expenditure	  5,127.45 vs  4,463.95</p>
<p>    Deposits		    46,033.95 vs 36,971.65</p>
<p>    Borrowings		   2,866.57 vs  2,676.82</p>
<p>Note: Federal Bank Ltd is one of India's major private banks operating from the southern state of Kerala.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
